1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,330
Selamat pagi!

2
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:18,040
Ini mirip Gu Eun Ho, 'kan?

3
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,710
Itu dia 'kan di lantai dua?

4
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:22,380
Eun Ho! Itu dia di sana!

5
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:28,130
[SMA Seni Segi]

6
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:30,390
[Jurusan Manajemen, Kelas 3-A]

7
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:32,690
- Sampai jumpa.
- Sampai nanti.

8
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:52,560
Jadi penggemar benar-benar melelahkan.
Aku mau tidur sebentar.

9
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:58,220
Katanya ada murid pindahan dari Jepang.
Dia ikut pertukaran.

10
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,490
Program Pertukaran Pelajar Internasional?

11
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:03,190
Ini pertama kalinya.

12
00:01:03,190 --> 00:01:07,280
Tapi kenapa baru sekarang pas dia kelas tiga?

13
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:11,740
Pasti dia perundung di sekolah
atau pernah bermasalah.

14
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:13,110
Apa?

15
00:01:13,110 --> 00:01:16,870
Entah dia dipaksa pindah
atau mau bersembunyi di luar negeri.

16
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:23,490
Bagaimana kalau dia...

17
00:01:23,490 --> 00:01:25,730
putri seorang gangster?

18
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:39,770
Dia mungkin punya tato naga di leher

19
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:44,070
dan luka sayat di wajah.

20
00:02:06,810 --> 00:02:08,920
Halo!

21
00:02:40,250 --> 00:02:44,770
[Episode 1: Halo, Hana-chan]

22
00:02:49,220 --> 00:02:51,010
Ya ampun, dia sungguh imut.

23
00:02:51,010 --> 00:02:54,530
Kurasa dia bukan putri gangster.

24
00:02:54,530 --> 00:02:55,580
Sepertinya begitu.

25
00:02:55,580 --> 00:02:57,090
Halo!

26
00:02:57,090 --> 00:02:59,550
Aku Hana Hirose dari Jepang.

27
00:02:59,550 --> 00:03:01,200
Aku sangat menyukai budaya Korea.

28
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:05,940
Aku bahkan anggota Klub Budaya Korea di Jepang.

29
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:09,430
Apa bagusnya budaya Korea?

30
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:13,610
Aku suka drama, film, musik, dan makanan Korea.

31
00:03:13,610 --> 00:03:16,940
Barusan dia menjawab pertanyaanku?

32
00:03:16,940 --> 00:03:18,370
Benar.

33
00:03:18,370 --> 00:03:19,920
Seperti samgyeopsal, aku berharap bisa
jadi teman yang menyenangkan untuk kalian.

34
00:03:23,170 --> 00:03:25,720
Kalian bisa memanggilku "Hana-chan".

35
00:03:29,250 --> 00:03:32,170
Kalian pasti menyimak saat kelas bahasa Jepang.

36
00:03:32,170 --> 00:03:35,050
Aku sangat terharu.

37
00:03:35,050 --> 00:03:37,800
Ibu tidak menyuruhnya duduk?

38
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,080
Maaf.

39
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:41,910
Baiklah. Kalau begitu...

40
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:44,640
duduklah di samping ketua kelas, Ji Ah.

41
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:46,110
Baik.

42
00:03:48,050 --> 00:03:49,370
Kalian sudah lihat, 'kan?

43
00:03:49,370 --> 00:03:53,010
Hana mengerti bahasa Korea.
Jadi, mengobrollah dengannya.

44
00:03:53,010 --> 00:03:56,290
Ji Ah, ajak dia berkeliling sekolah.

45
00:03:56,290 --> 00:04:00,020
Semoga hari kalian menyenangkan!

46
00:04:02,690 --> 00:04:05,990
Ji Ah, kita teman sebangku sekarang.

47
00:04:05,990 --> 00:04:08,170
Kurasa begitu.

48
00:04:08,170 --> 00:04:12,200
Apa Shin Ji Ah baru saja tersenyum?

49
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:15,050
Ke mana perginya sikap angkuh itu?

50
00:04:15,050 --> 00:04:16,640
Hore!

51
00:04:17,750 --> 00:04:19,330
Astaga.

52
00:04:21,070 --> 00:04:24,110
[Ruang Belajar, Jam Operasional]
[365 Hari, 24/7]

53
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:31,440
Ji Ah!

54
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:38,060
Kenapa kau kemari?
Sudah kubilang tidak perlu datang.

55
00:04:39,460 --> 00:04:41,270
Membiarkanmu membawa tas seberat ini?

56
00:04:41,270 --> 00:04:46,200
Akan kutanggung beban murid terbaik Manajemen.

57
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:52,110
Saat kau belajar, aku melatih otot bahuku.

58
00:04:53,790 --> 00:04:59,020
[Ruang Belajar Segi]

59
00:05:14,150 --> 00:05:17,440
Ada sesuatu di mulutmu.

60
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,460
- Terima kasih.
- Nomor yang Anda tuju tidak dapat dihubungi.

61
00:05:19,460 --> 00:05:22,030
Setelah nada berikut--

62
00:05:22,030 --> 00:05:23,150
Shama-shama.

63
00:05:23,150 --> 00:05:24,950
- "Sama-sama".
- Rasanya enak?

64
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:26,430
- Ya, enak.
- Benarkah?

65
00:05:26,430 --> 00:05:28,520
- Baguslah.
- Ini enak.

66
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:32,060
Bukankah itu Ji Ah?

67
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:33,560
Ji Ah.

68
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:38,040
Sepertinya kau kenal aku.

69
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:42,030
Pria ini pacarku. Tidak ada
yang boleh merebutnya dariku.

70
00:05:43,110 --> 00:05:45,020
Aku akan bawa dia bersamaku.

71
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:49,140
Ji Ah, tunggu sebentar.

72
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:51,850
Kau bilang hanya aku pacarmu.

73
00:05:51,850 --> 00:05:54,770
- Memang benar.
- Lalu dia siapa?

74
00:05:54,770 --> 00:05:56,810
Dia saudariku.

75
00:05:56,810 --> 00:05:59,080
Sepupu dari Jepang.

76
00:06:00,230 --> 00:06:02,470
Aku mengajaknya
karena dia ingin bertemu denganmu.

77
00:06:02,470 --> 00:06:06,130
Hana-chan menyukaimu.

78
00:06:06,130 --> 00:06:09,330
Dia merasa sudah mengenalmu.

79
00:06:09,330 --> 00:06:11,600
Kenapa begitu?

80
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:14,530
Sebab aku selalu memujimu.

81
00:06:15,950 --> 00:06:18,120
Mau menyapanya?

82
00:06:18,890 --> 00:06:20,660
Tidak mau.

83
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:25,720
Benar tidak mau?

84
00:06:37,050 --> 00:06:38,760
Ji Ah!

85
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:43,150
Di Korea, teman menggandeng lengan, 'kan?

86
00:06:43,150 --> 00:06:45,930
Ya. Ayo.

87
00:06:45,930 --> 00:06:48,260
Ayo.

88
00:06:48,260 --> 00:06:52,310
Ada tiga jurusan di SMA Seni Segi.

89
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:54,860
Jurusan Penyutradaraan,
Seni Peran, dan Manajemen.

90
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:59,530
Kita mulai dari Jurusan Penyutradaraan.

91
00:06:59,530 --> 00:07:01,120
[Jurusan Penyutradaraan]

92
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:05,290
Mereka menang banyak penghargaan,

93
00:07:05,290 --> 00:07:07,150
calon sutradara sejati yang bercerita
lewat pergantian sudut kamera.

94
00:07:10,940 --> 00:07:13,880
Siap... Mulai!

95
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:15,920
Lalu Jurusan Seni Peran.

96
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:19,550
Para bintang baru dengan pesona dan bakat.
[Jurusan Seni Peran]

97
00:07:19,550 --> 00:07:25,070
Mereka mencuri perhatian tanpa perlu usaha.

98
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:37,600
Jurusan terakhir yang membuat
para bintang ini bersinar

99
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:40,460
dan menjadi kekuatan terbesar
sekolah kita adalah Manajemen.

100
00:07:41,130 --> 00:07:46,060
Mereka bekerja di balik layar
dan memastikan semuanya berjalan lancar.

101
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:50,760
[Jadwal Syuting]

102
00:07:53,430 --> 00:07:56,650
Keren sekali!

103
00:07:56,650 --> 00:07:59,110
Hana-chan, ayo pergi.

104
00:08:02,970 --> 00:08:06,670
Ruang kostum, ruang latihan, dan ruang teater.

105
00:08:06,670 --> 00:08:10,590
Sepertinya sudah semua.
Ada yang ingin kau tanyakan?

106
00:08:10,590 --> 00:08:13,480
Ji Ah, kau sudah menonton film ini?
[Aku Akan Melakukan Segalanya Untukmu]

107
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:15,640
Aku sudah menontonnya lebih dari sepuluh kali.

108
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:19,480
Detektif memberikan kunci kantornya
kepada seorang anak,

109
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:24,110
lalu bilang "Ini kuncinya. Kalau kau dipukuli
ayahmu lagi, datanglah kemari."

110
00:08:24,110 --> 00:08:31,090
Gu Eun Ho, si aktor cilik yang tampan
dengan kemampuan akting luar biasa.

111
00:08:31,090 --> 00:08:33,590
Kurasa dia tidak banyak berubah.

112
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:47,780
Itu Gu Eun Ho, murid terbaik Seni Peran.

113
00:08:47,780 --> 00:08:50,070
Sahabatnya yang terkenal, Cheon Si Woo.

114
00:08:50,070 --> 00:08:53,410
Kepribadiannya lebih baik dari Gu Eun Ho.

115
00:08:53,410 --> 00:08:57,260
Na Min Soo, influencer dengan
200 ribu pengikut. Dia suka berbuat jahil.

116
00:08:57,260 --> 00:09:01,400
Tampan, bisa diandalkan, dan baik.

117
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:04,880
Itulah Ba Reun yang menawan.

118
00:09:06,410 --> 00:09:09,710
Mereka adalah
Empat Murid Terbaik SMA Seni Segi.

119
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:16,440
- Eun Ho!
- Eun Ho!

120
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:25,020
Jadi, kau Hana-chan yang dari Jepang, ya?

121
00:09:25,020 --> 00:09:26,680
Halo!

122
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:29,950
Ikuti ucapanku, "Dinosaurus".

123
00:09:29,950 --> 00:09:32,060
"Dinosorus"?

124
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:35,440
Lain kali, bilang itu daripada "Halo"--

125
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:37,770
Jangan menjahilinya.

126
00:09:37,770 --> 00:09:40,670
Pasti akan lucu.

127
00:09:40,670 --> 00:09:41,900
Sepertinya tidak.

128
00:09:41,900 --> 00:09:45,350
Lihat dirimu di cermin.
Kau mirip Tyrannosaurus.

129
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:47,280
- Sialan.
- Baiklah.

130
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:50,250
Lain kali aku akan bilang, "Halo-sorus".

131
00:09:50,250 --> 00:09:52,960
Bagus. Aku suka itu.

132
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:55,180
S.B.D.M!

133
00:09:55,180 --> 00:09:56,890
"S.B.D.M"?

134
00:09:56,890 --> 00:10:00,020
Itu artinya senang berkenalan denganmu.

135
00:10:00,740 --> 00:10:02,840
Aku juga.

136
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:05,540
Kami pergi dulu. Sampai jumpa.

137
00:10:37,290 --> 00:10:39,660
Sekolah baru.

138
00:10:42,570 --> 00:10:44,130
[Edit, Kolase, Gaya Majalah, Kamera,
Kecantikan, Lab Video]

139
00:10:58,420 --> 00:11:00,770
Seragam baru.

140
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:16,810
Teman... baru?

141
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:25,330
Kau Eun Ho, 'kan? Selamat memperingati
sepuluh tahun penghargaanmu.

142
00:11:25,330 --> 00:11:28,770
- Aku sungguh--
- Kau penggemarku?

143
00:11:28,770 --> 00:11:31,170
Semua orang bilang begitu kepadaku.

144
00:11:32,420 --> 00:11:36,220
Aku masih mengoleksi kunci itu.

145
00:11:36,220 --> 00:11:39,220
Kenapa mengoleksi benda jelek itu?

146
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:41,880
Semua orang sudah pakai
kunci elektronik sekarang.

147
00:12:07,250 --> 00:12:09,390
Dor!

148
00:12:09,390 --> 00:12:11,540
- Halo-sorus!
- Halo-sorus!

149
00:12:11,540 --> 00:12:13,230
Hari ini menyenangkan!

150
00:12:13,230 --> 00:12:14,690
Apanya yang menyenangkan?

151
00:12:14,690 --> 00:12:18,700
Menyapa orang dengan benar itu
tidak mudah, bodoh. Terdengar bagus, 'kan?

152
00:12:18,700 --> 00:12:21,660
Hana-puf, aku haus.

153
00:12:21,660 --> 00:12:24,260
Kau haus? Tunggu sebentar.

154
00:12:24,260 --> 00:12:26,440
Kenapa dipanggil "Hana-puf"?

155
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:28,560
Aku mengamati dia selama sepekan.

156
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:31,660
Puf! Dia muncul di sekolah.
Puf! Semua ada di tasnya.

157
00:12:31,660 --> 00:12:34,890
Jadilah "Hana-puf".

158
00:12:34,890 --> 00:12:36,330
Ini.

159
00:12:36,330 --> 00:12:37,600
Terima kasih banyak.

160
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:38,830
Sama-sama.

161
00:12:38,830 --> 00:12:41,840
- Ayo.
- Kau cukup unik.

162
00:12:55,620 --> 00:12:57,400
[Jurusan Seni Peran, Kelas 3-A]

163
00:13:02,710 --> 00:13:04,790
[Untuk Eun Ho]
[Dari Murid Kelas Satu, Jung Eun]

164
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,690
[Semoga kalian suka!]

165
00:13:06,690 --> 00:13:08,250
Mau ke mana?

166
00:13:08,250 --> 00:13:09,880
Kerja sukarela.

167
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:11,440
Tangkap ini.

168
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:14,540
Aku diminta berbagi.

169
00:13:14,540 --> 00:13:16,730
Kau terima hadiah dari murid kelas satu juga?

170
00:13:16,730 --> 00:13:18,780
Tidak mungkin kubuang.

171
00:13:28,870 --> 00:13:30,860
Ambil satu.

172
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:35,030
Ji Ah!

173
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,250
[Peter Drucker, Manajemen]

174
00:13:37,250 --> 00:13:39,830
Sebelumnya kau juga baca buku yang sama.

175
00:13:39,830 --> 00:13:43,910
Meski ratusan kali baca buku yang sama,
Raja Sejong selalu menemukan hal baru.

176
00:13:43,910 --> 00:13:48,210
Dia berusaha memahami dan memikirkan
cara terbaik untuk menggunakan pengetahuannya.

177
00:13:48,210 --> 00:13:50,390
Keren sekali!

178
00:13:50,390 --> 00:13:52,970
Kau benar-benar cerdas.

179
00:13:52,970 --> 00:13:56,910
Apa buku ini ada di perpustakaan?
Aku juga ingin membacanya.

180
00:13:56,910 --> 00:13:59,830
Tapi kau akan kesulitan
karena bukunya dalam bahasa Korea.

181
00:13:59,830 --> 00:14:03,350
Tidak apa-apa. Aku tetap ingin membacanya.

182
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:11,260
[Geografi Benua Eropa, Perjalanan...]

183
00:14:19,090 --> 00:14:22,520
[Papan Cerita: Cara Membuat Animasi...]

184
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:55,840
Si Woo?

185
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:58,330
Apa kau suka kue Madeleine?

186
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,880
Ya.

187
00:15:01,620 --> 00:15:03,340
Tunggu sebentar.

188
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,910
Aku tidak sengaja tahu hal ini.

189
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:16,000
Lupakan saja. Kau pasti mengira aku berbohong.

190
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,960
Ada apa?

191
00:15:19,300 --> 00:15:22,500
Rak ini menyimpan rahasia.

192
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:26,060
Kue akan muncul dari buku.

193
00:15:26,830 --> 00:15:29,170
Apa maksudmu?

194
00:15:29,170 --> 00:15:31,050
Itu benar.

195
00:15:33,540 --> 00:15:36,050
Mau kutunjukkan?

196
00:15:37,630 --> 00:15:40,840
Kue Madeleine dari Prancis, 'kan?

197
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:43,110
Ini.

198
00:15:44,630 --> 00:15:48,820
Rahasia ini hanya
kita berdua yang tahu. Mengerti?

199
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:54,000
Pertama, buka halaman 111.

200
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,970
Halaman 111?

201
00:15:55,970 --> 00:15:58,350
Benar.

202
00:15:58,350 --> 00:16:01,030
Sekarang tutup matamu.

203
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:04,110
Kue Madeleine, muncullah!

204
00:16:04,110 --> 00:16:07,710
Kue Madeleine, muncullah!

205
00:16:09,330 --> 00:16:11,170
Buka matamu.

206
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:14,090
Wow!

207
00:16:14,090 --> 00:16:16,170
Apa ini benar-benar muncul dari buku?

208
00:16:16,170 --> 00:16:18,400
- Ya.
- Apa kue lain juga muncul?

209
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:22,670
Pai apel, kroisan, roti asin, roti melon...

210
00:16:22,670 --> 00:16:24,560
dan piza!

211
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:27,130
Aku mau piza Chicago.

212
00:16:28,190 --> 00:16:29,580
Piza?

213
00:16:29,580 --> 00:16:32,580
Baik. Piza dari Amerika.

214
00:16:33,470 --> 00:16:34,860
Ini.

215
00:16:37,870 --> 00:16:40,680
Buka halaman 111...

216
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:42,210
Sudah.

217
00:16:42,210 --> 00:16:44,760
Aku harus tutup mata, 'kan?

218
00:16:46,290 --> 00:16:49,080
Piza, muncullah!

219
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,460
Maaf.

220
00:16:53,460 --> 00:16:55,490
Piza tidak akan muncul.

221
00:16:56,410 --> 00:16:59,370
Apaan, sih.

222
00:16:59,370 --> 00:17:01,480
Kemarikan bukunya.

223
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:03,140
Ini.

224
00:17:06,090 --> 00:17:07,480
[Kelas Gabungan, Kelas 3-A]

225
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:10,040
[Kelas Praktik Jurusan]

226
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:12,190
Kalian di sini untuk praktik jurusan.

227
00:17:12,190 --> 00:17:15,000
Kelas gabungan ini
punya kebiasaan turun-temurun.

228
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:18,900
Tiap kelompok akan terdiri atas
1 murid Manajemen dan 2 murid Seni Peran.

229
00:17:18,900 --> 00:17:22,060
Kalau sekolah lain ada
ujian tengah semester, kalau kita?

230
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:24,750
Kita punya tugas tengah semester.

231
00:17:24,750 --> 00:17:28,440
Aku akan mengumumkan kelompoknya.

232
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:30,560
Ji Ah, Ba Reun, dan Min Soo.

233
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:32,070
Bagus!

234
00:17:32,070 --> 00:17:34,520
Shin Ji Ah pasti akan membuatku bekerja keras.

235
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:37,230
Seul Gi, Ji Ho, dan Yoo Jin.

236
00:17:37,230 --> 00:17:43,000
Lalu... Bit Na, Kyung Joon, dan Jung Hoon.

237
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:48,510
Dan tim terakhir yang berpotensi
tapi mengkhawatirkan, Hana, Eun Ho, dan Si Woo.

238
00:17:54,390 --> 00:17:56,660
Kau dari sekolah umum, 'kan?

239
00:17:59,570 --> 00:18:01,680
Tatapan seseorang
yang tidak akan banyak membantu.

240
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:03,150
Tidak boleh begitu.

241
00:18:03,150 --> 00:18:06,340
Kau harus bantu kalau dia tidak tahu.

242
00:18:07,190 --> 00:18:10,180
Ji Ah, bantu Hana juga, ya?

243
00:18:10,180 --> 00:18:11,780
Baik.

244
00:18:12,630 --> 00:18:15,430
Yang benar saja.

245
00:18:15,430 --> 00:18:17,440
Terima kasih.

246
00:18:24,430 --> 00:18:27,980
Ji Ah, hanya kau yang bisa membantuku.

247
00:18:27,980 --> 00:18:31,210
Sayangnya ini tugas kelompok.

248
00:18:31,210 --> 00:18:34,270
Apa Eun Ho juga murid terbaik di jurusannya?

249
00:18:34,270 --> 00:18:35,700
Benar.

250
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:41,320
Haruskah kita adakan pertandingan basket
antar ketua kelompok?

251
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:44,490
Belakangan ini dingin sekali.

252
00:18:44,490 --> 00:18:46,890
Kenapa? Kau takut?

253
00:18:46,890 --> 00:18:49,830
Menyerahlah kalau takut.

254
00:18:52,030 --> 00:18:53,420
Aku?

255
00:18:53,420 --> 00:18:57,080
Takut?

256
00:18:58,810 --> 00:19:02,200
Ayo bertanding. Yang kalah traktir makan.

257
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:05,130
"Yang kalah traktir makan."

258
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:09,340
Hana-chan!

259
00:19:09,340 --> 00:19:12,610
Kami akan bertanding basket. Mau menonton?

260
00:19:12,610 --> 00:19:15,860
Tentu aku mau. Aku manajer kalian.

261
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:22,980
Kau juga ikut menonton, 'kan?

262
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:27,470
Aku harus bersiap untuk kelas umum.

263
00:19:27,470 --> 00:19:29,830
Kukira kau akan ikut.

264
00:19:29,830 --> 00:19:33,970
Lebih baik gunakan waktu ini
untuk mengerjakan latihan soal.

265
00:19:50,710 --> 00:19:52,540
Tembakan yang bagus!

266
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:53,610
Giliranmu.

267
00:19:53,610 --> 00:19:55,780
Ambil fotonya sekarang. Cepat!

268
00:19:55,780 --> 00:19:58,710
- Perbesar!
- Eun Ho! Si Woo!

269
00:19:58,710 --> 00:20:00,560
Kalian pasti bisa!

270
00:20:00,560 --> 00:20:02,500
Hana-puf, bagaimana denganku?

271
00:20:02,500 --> 00:20:04,670
Kau hanya menyemangati kelompokmu.

272
00:20:13,190 --> 00:20:15,460
Lalu kenapa?

273
00:20:16,410 --> 00:20:19,430
- Kami pasti akan menang.
- Ya ampun!

274
00:20:19,430 --> 00:20:21,810
Kau dengar itu?

275
00:20:21,810 --> 00:20:26,010
Maaf! Dia bilang kami akan menang!

276
00:20:26,890 --> 00:20:30,720
Eun Ho! Si Woo! Kalian pasti bisa!

277
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:32,650
Lakukan yang terbaik!

278
00:21:07,530 --> 00:21:11,300
Tembakan yang bagus!

279
00:21:13,130 --> 00:21:14,780
Kau yang traktir.

280
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:22,860
Hei.

281
00:21:22,860 --> 00:21:25,760
Biarkan saja. Dia akan kembali
kalau sudah tenang.

282
00:21:25,760 --> 00:21:27,750
Lagi pula, ini bukan kali pertama.

283
00:21:27,750 --> 00:21:29,650
Kerja bagus!

284
00:21:29,650 --> 00:21:30,880
- Ini.
- Terima kasih.

285
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:33,290
- Ini.
- Terima kasih!

286
00:21:33,290 --> 00:21:35,230
Eun Ho kenapa?

287
00:21:37,710 --> 00:21:39,970
Bung, aku gugup.

288
00:21:39,970 --> 00:21:42,030
Jangan sampai ketahuan.

289
00:21:45,710 --> 00:21:47,540
Kita mau ke mana?

290
00:21:47,540 --> 00:21:50,870
Tempat persembunyian kami, Ruang Klub Drama.

291
00:21:50,870 --> 00:21:53,650
- Tempat persembunyian?
- Kita hampir sampai.

292
00:22:47,070 --> 00:22:48,520
[Selamat datang]

293
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:51,860
Tunggu di sini.

294
00:23:18,460 --> 00:23:20,340
[Selamat datang]

295
00:23:27,450 --> 00:23:30,290
Kenapa dia berdiri di situ?

296
00:23:37,090 --> 00:23:39,670
Kejutan!

297
00:24:14,280 --> 00:24:15,950
Masuklah.
[Epilog]

298
00:24:20,800 --> 00:24:22,690
Silakan duduk.

299
00:24:31,320 --> 00:24:34,200
Tenanglah. Tidak perlu tegang.

300
00:24:34,200 --> 00:24:35,860
Baik.

301
00:24:36,490 --> 00:24:39,570
Mari kita mulai.

302
00:24:43,950 --> 00:24:47,870
Akhir-akhir ini Hana Hirose jadi sorotan.
Apa benar kau teman sekelasnya?

303
00:24:50,410 --> 00:24:53,740
Seperti apa dia di sekolah?

304
00:24:58,990 --> 00:25:01,590
Dia orang paling jahat.

305
00:25:01,590 --> 00:25:05,900
Dia mengerikan.
Orang paling mengerikan yang pernah kutemui.
